    "site_desc": "This tower is located in St Jones, near Dover Delaware. This area is part of the National Estuarine Research Reserve. It was established in 1993, and estuarine ecosystems from the Mid-Atlantic region are represented here. This region has been influenced by agricultural fields along the watershed. The EC tower is located in a tidal marsh near the Dover headquarters, there is a board walk that goes along the marsh. Restoring natural vegetation is on the long term management plan.",
